/-!
# Central root geometry of the standard symplectic Sylow subgroup

Explicit positive-root matrices give the center, its elementary structure,
the Frattini subgroup for q > 2, the maximum-elementary Thompson subgroup,
and the actual diagonal Cartan action. Every subgroup retains its inclusion
in the concrete symplectic four-space group.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, Lemma 16.5.13, printed p.1202.
-/
